      <SectionHeader title="Challenges & Solutions" />
      <div class="space-y-16">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-gray-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Technical Challenges</h3>

            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">API Integration Without a Backend</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                  With the backend still in development, we needed a way to build and test the frontend independently.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 bg-gray-900/50 p-3 rounded-lg">
                  <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                    <span class="text-primary font-medium">Solution:</span> Implemented Mock Service Worker to simulate API responses based on OpenAPI specifications, allowing us to develop with realistic data flows.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">Complex Booking Logic</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                  The booking system required handling of multiple interdependent factors: practitioner availability, service types, location options, and credit balances.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 bg-gray-900/50 p-3 rounded-lg">
                  <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                    <span class="text-primary font-medium">Solution:</span> Created a state machine using XState to manage the complex booking flow, ensuring consistent user experiences across different paths and edge cases.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">Performance Optimization</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                  Initial dashboard implementations suffered from performance issues when displaying large datasets and complex visualizations.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 bg-gray-900/50 p-3 rounded-lg">
                  <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                    <span class="text-primary font-medium">Solution:</span> Implemented virtualized lists, optimized re-renders with React.memo and useMemo, and added progressive loading for dashboard components.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
