                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 bg-gray-900/50 p-3 rounded-lg">
                  <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                    <span class="text-primary font-medium">Solution:</span> Applied progressive disclosure principles, creating a dashboard that reveals additional options contextually as needed, with common tasks always accessible.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">Meeting Diverse Corporate Needs</h4>
