                    <span class="text-primary font-medium">Solution:</span> Developed a configurable permissions system and customizable dashboard modules that could be enabled or disabled based on client needs.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">Accessibility Requirements</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
