                    <span class="text-primary font-medium">Solution:</span> Incorporated accessibility from the beginning, with keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and WCAG 2.1 AA compliance as core requirements in the design system.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
